            ("2.2", ["sf-pd1", "automation"], "An approval process updates a field after approval. A before-update trigger also sets the same field. Which runs first on the approval save?", ["Before triggers, then validation, then save — approval field updates follow workflow/approval steps", "Approval always overrides triggers", "Triggers never run on approval updates", "Flows always run before triggers"], [0], "Approval actions cause a save that follows the standard order. Before triggers run early in that save."),
